OL,3,GNEWSAHow ready is Suffolk for the next
OL,4,Amajor incident?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSnow storms, floods, tidal surges and
OL,7,Ffires have been among the crises
OL,8,Fdeclared major incidents in Suffolk in
OL,9,Frecent years.
OL,11,FThere have been six since 2017. Five
OL,12,Fclimate related, plus the Covid
OL,13,Fpandemic.
OL,15,FAccording to a UK framework for
OL,16,Fcritical situations, a major incident
OL,17,Fis an "event or situation with a range
OL,18,Fof serious consequences which requires
OL,19,Fspecial arrangements by one or more
OL,20,Femergency responding agencies".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
