OL,3,GNEWSAHow ready is Suffolk for the next
OL,4,Amajor incident?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the government urging households
OL,7,Fto have three days' supply of bottled
OL,8,Fwater and tinned food in readiness for
OL,9,Fwar, an online attack or a natural
OL,10,Fdisaster - how prepared are Suffolk's
OL,11,Fauthorities?
